OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F369A1785757675
OL,3,CInvestigation launched into death of
OL,4,Cautistic man restrained in handcuffs
OL,6,FThe police watchdog has launched an
OL,7,Finvestigation into the death of an
OL,8,Fautistic man who became unresponsive
OL,9,Fafter he was restrained with handcuffs
OL,10,Fby officers responding to a report of
OL,11,Fconcern for his welfare.
OL,13,FThe Independent Office for Police
OL,14,FConduct (IOPC) said on Friday that
OL,15,Fthey would be investigating the
OL,16,Fcircumstances surrounding the death of
OL,17,FRicky Swindells, 28, in Salford,
OL,18,FGreater Manchester.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/8
