OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,370,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36902
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F369A1785757675
OL,3,CInvestigation launched into death of
OL,4,Cautistic man restrained in handcuffs
OL,6,FOfficers from Greater Manchester
OL,7,FPolice were called to an address in
OL,8,Fthe city on July 24 after receiving a
OL,9,Freport of a concern for Mr Swindells'
OL,10,Fwelfare, the IOPC said.
OL,12,FDuring the phone call, Mr Swindells'
OL,13,Ffamily reportedly told officers that
OL,14,Fhe was autistic and in "significant
OL,15,Fdistress".
OL,17,FAt the property, police used handcuffs
OL,18,Fto restrain Mr Swindells, with body-
OL,19,Fworn footage showing officers say
OL,20,F"this was done for his own safety",
OL,21,Fthe IOPC said.
OL,26,@vD@XOUwD@IO]|D@AOU|D@bO]
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/8
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
