OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,370,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36903
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F369A1785757675
OL,3,CInvestigation launched into death of
OL,4,Cautistic man restrained in handcuffs
OL,6,FMr Swindells became unresponsive and
OL,7,Freceived medical treatment at the
OL,8,Fscene. He was taken to hospital where
OL,9,Fhe died on July 25.
OL,11,FThe cause of his death has not yet
OL,12,Fbeen confirmed, the police watchdog
OL,13,Fsaid.
OL,15,FGMP said they were "supporting an
OL,16,Findependent investigation" into the
OL,17,Fdeath of a man who was "restrained by
OL,18,Fofficers responding to a report by
OL,19,Ffamily members of a man in crisis".
OL,26,@wD@TOUxD@ZO]yD@XOU{D@bO]
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/8
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,370,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36904
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F369A1785757675
OL,3,CInvestigation launched into death of
OL,4,Cautistic man restrained in handcuffs
OL,6,FThe force said that response officers
OL,7,Fwere called at 7.40pm after receiving
OL,8,Freports that the man was having a
OL,9,Fpotential mental episode and had been
OL,10,Fviolent.
OL,12,FThey said the man was "presenting as
OL,13,Fin crisis on the floor", and appeared
OL,14,Fto be in distress.
OL,16,FThe force said the man was placed in
OL,17,Fhandcuffs for his own safety, and that
OL,18,Fwhile detained, officers worked to try
OL,19,Fto calm the incident.
OL,26,@tD@WOUuD@WO]
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G4/8
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,370,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36905
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F369A1785757675
OL,3,CInvestigation launched into death of
OL,4,Cautistic man restrained in handcuffs
OL,6,FIOPC director of engagement Amanda
OL,7,FRowe said: "Our thoughts are with Mr
OL,8,FSwindells' family and loved ones, as
OL,9,Fwell as all those affected by his
OL,10,Fdeath.
OL,12,F"Our investigation will be entirely
OL,13,Findependent of the police and ensure
OL,14,Fwe understand events surrounding his
OL,15,Fdetention. We will carefully examine
OL,16,Fthe actions and decision-making of
OL,17,Fofficers involved ` including the
OL,18,Frestraint used in this case.
OL,26,@oD@LOUtD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G5/8
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,370,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36906
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F369A1785757675
OL,3,CInvestigation launched into death of
OL,4,Cautistic man restrained in handcuffs
OL,6,F"This was clearly an extremely
OL,7,Fdistressing incident and our
OL,8,Finvestigation will be thorough to help
OL,9,Festablish the facts and get answers to
OL,10,Fthe family's questions. Our findings
OL,11,Fwill be shared with the coroner in due
OL,12,Fcourse."
OL,14,FGMP Assistant Chief Constable Steph
OL,15,FParker said: "This is a really
OL,16,Fdistressing time for all concerned `
OL,17,Fparticularly the family of the man who
OL,18,Fhas sadly passed away after this
OL,19,Fincident. We are doing what we can to
OL,20,Festablish what happened to answer any
OL,21,Fquestions they will have.
OL,26,@nD@AOUtD@HO]wD@NOU
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G6/8
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,370,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36907
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F369A1785757675
OL,3,CInvestigation launched into death of
OL,4,Cautistic man restrained in handcuffs
OL,6,F"Our officers attended to try to help
OL,7,Fwhat was a complex and challenging
OL,8,Fcircumstance. We are ensuring they are
OL,9,Fgetting the support they need at this
OL,10,Ftime.
OL,12,F"It is vital that a proper
OL,13,Finvestigation, independent of the
OL,14,Fpolice, is able to be carried out.
OL,16,F"We are fully assisting with the
OL,17,FIOPC's inquiries and are committed to
OL,18,Faccountability to help ensure the
OL,19,Ffacts are established."
OL,26,@nD@AOUtD@AOUxD@AOU{D@WO]
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G7/8
