CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F369A1785757675
OL,3,CInvestigation launched into death of
OL,4,Cautistic man restrained in handcuffs
OL,6,FGreater Manchester Police also say
OL,7,Ftheir Professional Standards
OL,8,FDirectorate have made initial
OL,9,Fenquiries including reviewing all
OL,10,Favailable body-worn video and other
OL,11,Favailable footage.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G8/8
